# --- build output (2026-10-02 cleanup) -------------------------------------
# A packaged XPI is a DERIVED artifact: `node build-xpi.js` regenerates it
# byte-for-byte from extension/. Twenty-six of them had accumulated as untracked
# files, which is why the working tree never returned to clean and why it was
# impossible to tell a real source change from build litter.
#
# 1.2.0/1.4.0/1.5.0/1.5.1 remain TRACKED: they are the historical baselines
# the recovery commits are built on. This rule only stops NEW ones appearing.
gce-don-control-bar-*.xpi
!gce-don-control-bar-1.2.0.xpi
!gce-don-control-bar-1.4.0.xpi
!gce-don-control-bar-1.5.0.xpi
!gce-don-control-bar-1.5.1.xpi
*.zip

# CANON 1.7.9 is frozen outside the repo, under
# 99_ARCHIVE\GCE_ControlBar_CANON_1.7.9_2026-10-02\, with its own source
# copy and CANON.md. The XPI itself is intentionally NOT tracked here. The
# frozen record is authoritative for 1.7.9; this repo is the working surface
# for whatever comes next.

# Scratch verification output from ad-hoc probes.
probe-*.js
_extract_probe.js